    {
      "id": "W7225182422",
      "doi": "10.1364/ol.620725",
      "title": "Laplacian-Regularized Sphere Shaping for Temporal Energy Smoothing and Nonlinear Interference Mitigation",
      "authors": [
        "Honglei Yang",
        "Chenglin Bai",
        "Lishan Yang",
        "Hengying Xu",
        "Yining Zhang",
        "Xinkuo Yu",
        "Tongxin Yang",
        "Xusheng Li",
        "Xiaozheng Li",
        "Zening Zhang"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics Letters",
      "venue_abbr": "OL",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "Laplacian regularization",
        "optical pulse shaping"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/ol.620725",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/bd55531a-2481-404d-8d11-595415066921.html",
      "summary": "论文提出一种用于短块长概率整形光传输的拉普拉斯正则化球形整形方案。该方案将前一符号的幅度作为一阶记忆状态，在枚举球形整形（ESS）的网格中约束相邻符号的能量变化。摘要报告，该方案在保持整形效率的同时降低了整形序列的时域能量波动和高阶矩。在 60 Gbaud、405.2 km 标准单模光纤传输实验中，摘要报告其有效信噪比较 ESS 提高 0.59 dB，并在目标归一化广义互信息（NGMI）门限下较 Band-ESS 获得 1.18 dB 的入纤功率优势。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
